ons"}],"versions":[{"guide":"","html":"<article><h1>Last Shelter</h1><p><br /></p><h2>Setting</h2><p>The Last Shelter is a concealed community of fugitives led by Brother Khatul. Its smith, fighters, thieves and disgraced necromancer help Zak investigate Suslanger. Solidarity and fear of discovery shape their decisions, while the Faceless Brother hides a danger within the refuge. [1, 2, 3, 4]</p><h2>Sources</h2><p>Based on the original game dialogue and world descriptions. Source numbers refer to the scenes listed below.</p><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>#</th><th>Sources</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>World description · Last Shelter (zone bz14h)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/glav\">Brother Khatul</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing gl64)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/zaku\">Brother Faceless</a> (briefing s64)</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/nekro\">Kehel</a> (briefing ne64_1)</td></tr></table><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>Property</th><th>Value</th></tr><tr><td>Island</td><td><a href=\"wiki://allod/suslanger\">Suslanger</a></td></tr></table><h2>Connected locations</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Maps</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz17h\">Necromancers' desert</a></td></tr></table><h2>Inhabitants</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Related page</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/kuzn\">Brother Blacksmith</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/guru\">Brother Blind</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/zaku\">Brother Faceless</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/glav\">Brother Khatul</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/merc8\">Fayrakh</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/nekro\">Kehel</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/merc7\">Kharad</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/merc10\">Sahilia</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Za